      m_Calls: []
  m_text: A tarnished brass compass rests in your hand, its edges worn smooth from
    years of use. The glass face is scratched, but the delicate needle inside still
    wavers with purpose, pointing true north. Tiny engravings of constellations encircle
    the edge, faint but discernible, as if to remind the owner of the vastness of
    the world. A faint scent of leather lingers from the cracked strap attached to
    its side, hinting at countless adventures under open skies.
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
  m_fontAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 8f586378b4e144a9851e7b34d9b748ee, type: 2}
